### Invoices - List all invoices
GET http://localhost:7071/api/v1/invoices
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Invoices - Filter by status
GET http://localhost:7071/api/v1/invoices?status=Pendiente
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Invoices - Get invoice by ID
GET http://localhost:7071/api/v1/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Invoices - Create invoice with all fields (con workOrderId)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/v1/invoices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

{
  "workOrderId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "description": "Cambio de aceite", "qty": 1, "price": 80000, "isLabor": true, "discountToTechnician": true },
    { "description": "Filtro de aceite", "qty": 1, "price": 35000, "isLabor": false, "discountToTechnician": false },
    { "description": "Alineación y balanceo", "qty": 1, "price": 60000, "isLabor": true, "discountToTechnician": true }
  ],
  "taxPct": true,
  "discount": 10000,
  "retention": 5000,
  "deposits": [
    { "amount": 50000, "date": "2026-06-09", "method": "Efectivo" },
    { "amount": 30000, "date": "2026-06-10", "method": "Transferencia" }
  ],
  "formaDePago": "Efectivo",
  "status": "Pendiente",
  "notes": "Cliente frecuente - aplicar descuento",
  "evidences": [
    { "type": "actual", "url": "https://blob.core.windows.net/evidences/foto-1.jpg" },
    { "type": "pasada", "url": "https://blob.core.windows.net/evidences/foto-2.jpg" }
  ],
  "showEvidencesInPdf": true
}

### Invoices - Create invoice without workOrderId (solo items)
