###
# MONEY MOVEMENTS ENDPOINTS (Require JWT Authentication)
###

### Money Movements - List all money movements
GET http://localhost:7071/api/v1/money-movements
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Money Movements - Filter by movement type
GET http://localhost:7071/api/v1/money-movements?movement=INGRESO
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Money Movements - Filter by account
GET http://localhost:7071/api/v1/money-movements?account=Caja Principal
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Money Movements - Filter by name (search)
GET http://localhost:7071/api/v1/money-movements?name=pago
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Money Movements - Get money movement by ID
GET http://localhost:7071/api/v1/money-movements/1
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Money Movements - Get money movement by non-existent ID (should fail 404)
GET http://localhost:7071/api/v1/money-movements/999999
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Money Movements - Create money movement with all fields
POST http://localhost:7071/api/v1/money-movements
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

{
  "reference": "REF-001",
  "name": "Pago de cliente",
  "concept": "Pago por servicios de mantenimiento",
  "movement": "INGRESO",
  "amount": 150000,
  "account": "Caja Principal",
  "observation": "Pago en efectivo",
  "date": "2026-07-01T10:00:00.000Z"
}

